{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>I will surely gather, like a flock in a fold</b> — Perhaps it is [about] this city." "<b>In the midst of Bozrah</b> — [It means] to the place where the flock was driven, like דוברות בים (enclosures in the sea), [from] the root of וינהג את הצאן (and he drove the flock). And likewise the beams were נוהגות (driven), or נהוגות (are driven)." "<b>Thus they shall roar</b> [with] <b>multitudes of men</b> — From an abundance of people, like המון אדם (a multitude of people)."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:46.811138457Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}